<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?><?xml-stylesheet href="http://www.blogger.com/styles/atom.css" type="text/css"?><feed xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom' xmlns:openSearch='http://a9.com/-/spec/opensearchrss/1.0/' xmlns:gd="http://schemas.google.com/g/2005"><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post7412778386850326440..comments</id><updated>2017-04-13T04:47:21.148-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Comments on Pro Libertate: Federally-Funded Niche-Market Nazis</title><link rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#feed' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/feeds/comments/default'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7412778386850326440/comments/default'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/02/federally-funded-niche-market-nazis.html'/><link rel="hub" href="http://pubsubhubbub.appspot.com/"/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='19' src='http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-5rhFUXs_62I/VgVL2E3rMII/AAAAAAAAMJ4/cjJOyI7W208/s220/Photo%2BRon%2BPaul%2BLiberty%2BReport.jpg'/></author><generator version='7.00' uri='http://www.blogger.com'>Blogger</generator><openSearch:totalResults>3</openSearch:totalResults><openSearch:startIndex>1</openSearch:startIndex><openSearch:itemsPerPage>25</openSearch:itemsPerPage><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6498823759686961306</id><published>2007-02-17T17:43:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2007-02-17T17:43:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>I can&#39;t believe I toyed with the idea of reading u...</title><content type='html'>I can&#39;t believe I toyed with the idea of reading up on these organizations but realized just how pathetic it all was.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;And whats up with the chicks?  Are they into being the equivalent of camp-following whores?  Thats sad.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;And if you ever do decide to create your own anti-whatever you&#39;d better damn well watch out for the knife in your back.  Agent provocateurs abound in this day of the quick pay off for betrayal.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7412778386850326440/comments/default/6498823759686961306'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7412778386850326440/comments/default/6498823759686961306'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/02/federally-funded-niche-market-nazis.html?showComment=1171759380000#c6498823759686961306' title=''/><author><name>DrFix</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/15912619928812368990</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/02/federally-funded-niche-market-nazis.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7412778386850326440' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/7412778386850326440' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-872085076"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 17, 2007 at 5:43 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6598511719144612734</id><published>2007-02-17T08:27:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2007-02-17T08:27:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>I didn&#39;t know your wife was ill, much less chronic...</title><content type='html'>I didn&#39;t know your wife was ill, much less &lt;I&gt;chronically&lt;/I&gt; ill, Will. I&#39;ll start praying for her speedy recovery; hey, you have not just one or two, but &lt;B&gt;five&lt;/B&gt; Grigglings that need to be looked after.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;In any event, my apologies Will. I must of missed you mentioning this in a previous post.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;I think you grok this already, but as you said in a prior posting, it &quot;shouldn&#39;t be necessary to say so, but I&#39;ll say it anyway&quot; for the uninitiated who may be experiencing their first or second jaunt around the block. The neo-Nazi movement, or any other movement for that matter, that doesn&#39;t parrot the statist positions expected will be shunned by the commoners by default. It&#39;s not even an issue and isn&#39;t even worth mentioning, IMO. And for those few who do indulge initially, attrition will  definitely cull the numbers over time, as you alluded to.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;When I was in my early 20s and a bit more fiery, energetic, and harbored some embedded resentment especially with regards to affirmative action minority programs I’ve dealt with, I admit that I was tempted at times to join some shady groups after I was discharged from the military. The groups in question were not Klan-affiliated or neo-Nazi groups, but were merely about promoting European ancestry more or less. I never did, especially after reading the &lt;I&gt;The Naked Communist&lt;/I&gt;. I discovered that many protest movements are instigated and kindled by collectivists, communists, and socialists, inside and outside government. Now, of course, it’s so clear.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Anyway, the reality is that the commoners (the herd) can always be counted on to obediently follow the proclamations of the government-media complex. Smoking is bad, drinking is good. Recreational drugs are bad, prescription (especially pecker/puss enhancement) drugs are good. One who’s opposed to affirmative action = racist. One who’s opposed to depravity-mongers being labeled yet another special class minority =  homophobe or hate-monger. And on the list goes.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;The commoners overall, minus the insignificant exception of those who would be labeled by media marionettes as “anti-social,” “racists,” “loners,” or “homophobes,” comply gladly.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7412778386850326440/comments/default/6598511719144612734'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7412778386850326440/comments/default/6598511719144612734'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/02/federally-funded-niche-market-nazis.html?showComment=1171726020000#c6598511719144612734' title=''/><author><name>dixiedog</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/09845646940134894119</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='32' src='http://members.cox.net/ogdenwb/images/dixiedog1.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/02/federally-funded-niche-market-nazis.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7412778386850326440' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/7412778386850326440' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-504942784"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 17, 2007 at 8:27 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2958949908040621949</id><published>2007-02-16T14:46:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2007-02-16T14:46:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>will,on the elohim city thing and tim mcveigh.  de...</title><content type='html'>will,&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;on the elohim city thing and tim mcveigh.  devvy kid had obtained a copy of his original death certificate.  it had his occupation as US Army.  it was later &quot;corrected&quot;.  maybe it was a mistake, maybe it was a cover up.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7412778386850326440/comments/default/2958949908040621949'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7412778386850326440/comments/default/2958949908040621949'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/02/federally-funded-niche-market-nazis.html?showComment=1171662360000#c2958949908040621949' title=''/><author><name>rick</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/12473173027048173880</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/02/federally-funded-niche-market-nazis.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7412778386850326440' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/7412778386850326440' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-870704727"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 16, 2007 at 2:46 PM"/></entry></feed>